      "eyebrow": "The program",
      "subheading": "",
      "description": "Cloud training that never leaves the console tends to fall apart the first time something breaks in production. This bootcamp is built around actually deploying, monitoring and fixing a real application.\n\nWe cover AWS, Azure and GCP at the level your projects need, and pair that with the DevOps habits (CI/CD, logging, alerting) that keep a deployment from becoming a 2am phone call.",
